# 🎮 Game Modes

## 🧊 Classic Mode

Classic Mode is the main mode built directly from the original **Frozen Giant Showdown** concept.

The complete original gameplay pool can be used as the foundation for Classic Mode, including:

- 🗿 Giant vs Tiny/Survivor structure
- ❤️ Giant health and objective structure
- 💥 Cannon-based Giant damage
- 🧗 Parkour progression
- 🪤 Giant environmental obstacles
- ⚡ Giant powers
- 🧰 Tiny temporary upgrades
- 🎁 Lucky items
- 🌨️ Visibility and movement disruption
- 🔔 Counter-power concepts
- ❤️ Short respawn after non-lethal falls

The exact implementation will be integrated with GIANTBOUND's lobby, map, customization, and reward systems during later design work.

## 🔮 Future Modes

GIANTBOUND is intended to support many modes in the future. A mode can change objectives, rules, powers, progression, or match structure while still using the same Giant/Tiny foundation.

Possible future directions include:

- ⚔️ Giant Hunt
- 🌲 Survival
- 🏆 Team Battle
- 🎉 Special Event Modes
- 💡 Completely new original modes

These are ideas only and are not finalized.

## 🔗 Mode and Map Independence

A mode should not be permanently tied to one map.

**Any compatible Map → Any compatible Mode**

This allows one map to support several modes and one mode to run across several maps.
